# Applies to `vercel` CLI uploads and to Git integration builds alike.
# Keep pipeline data and the Python service out of the upload: the web app reads only
# apps/web/public/data/ at build time. The leading "/" anchors each pattern at the repo root, so
# "/data/" never matches apps/web/public/data/ (an unanchored "data/" matches every data/ directory).
/data/
/services/
.venv/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
/.github/
/docs/
